---
import { LINKS, LIMITS, EFFECTIVE_L45, NOMINAL_L45 } from '../scripts/lab/ik';
const sliders = {
  ik: [
    ['x', 'X', -60, 280, 150, 'mm'],
    ['y', 'Y', -200, 200, 50, 'mm'],
    ['z', 'Z', 0, 320, 112, 'mm'],
    ['pitch', 'Pitch', -90, 30, -50, '°'],
  ],
  fk: [
    ['q1', 'q1 base', LIMITS.q1[0], LIMITS.q1[1], 18, '°'],
    ['q2', 'q2 shoulder', LIMITS.q2[0], LIMITS.q2[1], 60, '°'],
    ['q3', 'q3 elbow', LIMITS.q3[0], LIMITS.q3[1], -70, '°'],
    ['q4', 'q4 wrist', LIMITS.q4[0], LIMITS.q4[1], -40, '°'],
  ],
} as const;
---
<section class="lab" id="lab" aria-labelledby="lab-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="display h2" id="lab-h">Engineering Lab</h2>
      <p class="lead">Two simulations that run in your browser. Neither one is connected to hardware. Both use the geometric method from the thesis: law of cosines at the elbow, atan2 at the shoulder, the tool angle held by the wrist.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="lab-ik" id="lab-ik">
      <div class="lab-view">
        <canvas id="lab-canvas" aria-label="Three-dimensional view of the DOFBOT kinematic chain. Drag with a mouse to orbit." role="img"></canvas>
        <p class="lab-legend data"><span class="lg lg-x">x</span><span class="lg lg-y">y</span><span class="lg lg-z">z</span> base frame · 1 grid square = 50 mm</p>
        <noscript><p class="lab-legend">Turn on JavaScript to run the solver.</p></noscript>
      </div>

      <div class="lab-panel">
        <h3 class="h4">DOFBOT inverse kinematics</h3>
        <p class="lab-desc">A line-for-line port of the solver in <a class="link" href="https://github.com/saintbdrh/Vision-guided-robot-sorting/blob/main/ik_core.py">ik_core.py</a>, with the link lengths measured on the arm: <span class="data">L1 {LINKS.L1}, L2 {LINKS.L2}, L3 {LINKS.L3}, L4 {LINKS.L4}, L5 {LINKS.L5} mm</span>.</p>

        <div class="seg" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Mode">
          <label><input type="radio" name="lab-mode" value="ik" checked /><span>Inverse</span></label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="lab-mode" value="fk" /><span>Forward</span></label>
        </div>

        <fieldset class="sliders" id="lab-ik-inputs">
          <legend class="sr">Tool target</legend>
          {sliders.ik.map(([id, label, min, max, val, unit]) => (
            <div class="slider">
              <label for={`ik-${id}`}>{label}</label>
              <input type="range" id={`ik-${id}`} data-k={id} min={min} max={max} step="1" value={val} />
              <output class="data" for={`ik-${id}`} data-unit={unit}>{val} {unit}</output>
            </div>
          ))}
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset class="sliders" id="lab-fk-inputs" hidden>
          <legend class="sr">Joint angles</legend>
          {sliders.fk.map(([id, label, min, max, val, unit]) => (
            <div class="slider">
              <label for={`fk-${id}`}>{label}</label>
              <input type="range" id={`fk-${id}`} data-k={id} min={min} max={max} step="1" value={val} />
              <output class="data" for={`fk-${id}`} data-unit={unit}>{val}{unit}</output>
            </div>
          ))}
        </fieldset>

        <div class="lab-opts">
          <label class="field">
            <span>Wrist model</span>
            <select id="lab-wrist">
              <option value={EFFECTIVE_L45}>Effective {EFFECTIVE_L45} mm (thesis hover setting)</option>
              <option value={NOMINAL_L45.toFixed(1)}>Nominal L4 + L5 = {NOMINAL_L45.toFixed(1)} mm</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="lab-ws" checked /><span>Reachable workspace at this pitch</span></label>
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="lab-frames" checked /><span>Joint frames</span></label>
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="lab-ghost" checked /><span>Other elbow branch</span></label>
        </div>

        <p class="lab-status" id="lab-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Solving…</p>
        <dl class="readout data" id="lab-readout">
          <div><dt>q1</dt><dd data-r="q1">–</dd></div>
          <div><dt>q2</dt><dd data-r="q2">–</dd></div>
          <div><dt>q3</dt><dd data-r="q3">–</dd></div>
          <div><dt>q4</dt><dd data-r="q4">–</dd></div>
          <div><dt>x</dt><dd data-r="x">–</dd></div>
          <div><dt>y</dt><dd data-r="y">–</dd></div>
          <div><dt>z</dt><dd data-r="z">–</dd></div>
          <div><dt>pitch</dt><dd data-r="pitch">–</dd></div>
          <div><dt>branch</dt><dd data-r="branch">–</dd></div>
          <div><dt>D</dt><dd data-r="D">–</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <div class="lab-actions">
          <button class="btn" type="button" id="lab-run">Run thesis pick sequence</button>
          <button class="btn btn-quiet" type="button" id="lab-reset">Reset</button>
        </div>
        <p class="lab-fine">The sequence uses the constants in <span class="data">config.py</span>: approach at Z 112, pick at 105, lift to 118, place at (120, −40, 112), pitch −50°. The pick point (150, 50) is a sample; on the robot it came from the camera.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-cell">
      <div class="lab-cell-text">
        <h3 class="h4">Workcell sorter</h3>
        <p>Carried over from the previous version of this site: a planar three-joint arm with the tool held vertical, solved with the same geometric method. Select a block to sort it into the bin of matching hue, or point at the cell to steer the arm.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell" id="workcell">
        <div class="cell-bar">
          <p class="cell-title">Elevation view, mm</p>
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="det-toggle" checked /><span>Detections</span></label>
        </div>
        <svg id="cell" viewBox="0 0 460 330" role="group" aria-labelledby="cell-t cell-d">
          <title id="cell-t">Robot arm workcell</title>
          <desc id="cell-d">A three-joint arm solved with geometric inverse kinematics. Select a block to sort it into the bin of matching hue.</desc>
        </svg>
        <dl class="cell-tm data" aria-hidden="true">
          <div><dt>θ1 shoulder</dt><dd id="tm-a1">0.0°</dd></div>
          <div><dt>θ2 elbow</dt><dd id="tm-a2">0.0°</dd></div>
          <div><dt>θ3 wrist</dt><dd id="tm-a3">0.0°</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Gripper</dt><dd id="tm-g">Open</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Tool X</dt><dd id="tm-x">0.0 mm</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Tool Y</dt><dd id="tm-y">0.0 mm</dd></div>
          <div><dt>State</dt><dd id="tm-s">Idle</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Sorted</dt><dd id="tm-n">0 of 3</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <div class="cell-foot">
          <button class="btn" type="button" id="sort-all">Sort all</button>
          <button class="btn btn-quiet" type="button" id="reset" disabled>Reset</button>
        </div>
        <p class="sr" aria-live="polite" id="cell-live"></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
